# target_search: fly to a local-NED point keeping clear of the red mapped during the search.
# Straight (a flight_controller GoTo) when the line is clear of red + margin; otherwise the red-zone
# navigator's detour, then a final GoTo onto the point.
geometry_msgs/Point target    # local NED
float32 yaw                   # rad; NaN = keep
float32 speed                 # m/s; <= 0 = default
---
bool success
string message
bool detoured
---
string steering
